{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Implement 10 SOS Magic: The Gathering card implementations in `/workspace/cards/sos/`: cards 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257. Each card directory has `card_spec.json` (metadata) and a stub `card_impl.py` (bare `class X(CardImpl): pass`) to complete. Use completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as examples. Consult `RULEBOOK.txt` via grep (never read whole). The agent is \"expected to make changes to the engine to implement new keywords and mechanics\" and is \"free to make changes that don't break current behavior.\" Write per-card tests at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py`. Run tests from workspace root with `pytest`.\n\n   Hard constraints (MUST be preserved verbatim):\n   - \"Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading. Modifying the workspace tests will not change your score — it will only mislead you about whether your engine changes are correct.\"\n   - Do NOT modify or delete existing FDN reference test files at `cards/fdn/fdn_*/tests.py` (read for examples only).\n   - Engine modifications are ADDITIVE-ONLY: may add new methods/classes/helpers/files in `engine/` and may modify the bodies of existing functions, but MUST NOT rename, move, or delete anything existing in `engine/`.\n   - Each card's implementation class must remain in `cards/sos/{card_id}/card_impl.py`; do not move/rename card directories.\n   - Per-card SOS tests belong at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py`.\n   - pytest.ini sets `python_files = test_*.py tests.py`, 5-minute per-test timeout.\n\n   Most recent user message: produce a TEXT-ONLY summary (no tool calls).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Layered MTG engine: CardImpl hierarchy, GameState, Stack/StackObject, TriggerManager, ReplacementManager, EffectManager (7-layer continuous effects), CombatState, ManaPool, DeterministicPlayer.\n   - Card hooks: `can_cast`, `cost_reduction(game)` (generic-only, clamped ≥0), `on_cast`, `on_resolve` (reads `self.chosen_targets`), `get_targets` (returns list[TargetRequirement(filter_fn, description, zone)]), `register_triggers`, `register_replacement_effects`, `get_activated_abilities`, `get_modes`, Planeswalker `get_loyalty_abilities`, Land `get_mana_abilities`.\n   - `get_cost_reduction(game, card, controller)` (casting.py): sets card.controller temporarily, calls `card.cost_reduction(game)`, restores controller, clamps `max(0, min(raw, generic))`. Only call site is cast_spell. PLAN: additively iterate `controller.zones[Zone.BATTLEFIELD]` for `static_cost_reduction(game, card, controller)` hooks.\n   - Triggered events (events.py, all dataclasses, isinstance-matched): EntersBattlefield/LeavesBattlefield/CreatureDies (fired in zones.move_to_zone), DealsDamage/LosesLife/GainsLife/DrawsCard (game.py), BeginningOfUpkeep (turn.py). NOT fired but defined: SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell, player, card, controller), AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature, attacker), BeginningOfCombat, EndOfTurn, EndStep, Blocks, CounterAdded. No BeginningOfMainPhase event exists.\n   - TriggerManager.fire_event: collects matching triggers, returns early (no push) if none match → firing unfired events is safe when no triggers registered. APNAP orders; pushes StackObjects. TriggerRegistration(event_type, condition, effect, source, controller). `unregister(source)` is identity-based.\n   - move_to_zone (zones.py): only consults ReplacementManager when `replacement_event is not None AND leaving_battlefield`. Unregisters triggers/replacements ONLY when leaving battlefield. Fires events before unregister. Spell resolution (STACK→GRAVEYARD) does NOT leave battlefield, so triggers with source=self persist after an instant/sorcery resolves.\n   - casting.py `cast_spell`: step 4 moves hand→stack zone, deletes stale colors_spent; step 5 chooses targets (validates filter_fn, NOT zone — zone is metadata only); step 6 cost reduction + `player.mana_pool.pay(effective_cost)`; line 229 `card.colors_spent = list(player.mana_pool.last_payment_colors)`; line 232 `card.on_cast(game)`; step 8 builds StackObject + pushes. `cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone)` casts without paying, sets controller/owner, pushes StackObject. `_resolve_spell` sets `card.chosen_targets = stack_obj.targets`, calls on_resolve, then permanents→battlefield or instant/sorcery→graveyard via `move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.STACK, Zone.GRAVEYARD)` (no replacement_event).\n   - copy_spell(game, original_stackobj, controller, new_targets=None): shallow-copies source card, binds on_resolve to copied_card.on_resolve (no zone move), sets copied_card.chosen_targets = copy_obj.targets at resolve.\n   - ManaPool: add/empty/total/get/can_pay/pay/last_payment_colors (list[Color], colorless excluded). pay works on a copy then commits. No mana-spent total tracked → PLAN: set `card.mana_spent = total_before - total_after`.\n   - Continuous effects (continuous_effects.py): ContinuousEffect(source, layer, sublayer, apply, timestamp, duration). Layer IntEnum POWER_TOUGHNESS=7, ABILITY=6, TYPE=4. SubLayer MODIFY_PT/SET_PT/etc. DURATION_END_OF_TURN=0, DURATION_PERMANENT=-1. apply_all calls _reset_objects (each obj._reset_characteristics) then applies sorted effects. Cleanup calls remove_expired + apply_all. NOTE: card.py also defines a DIFFERENT ContinuousEffect(apply, remove, description) — use continuous_effects.ContinuousEffect for effect_manager.add.\n   - Creature: base_power/toughness, modified_power/toughness (reset to base each cycle), power/toughness properties include counters, _base_plus_one_counters/_base_minus_one_counters sync, _reset_characteristics clears _cant_*/protections. CardImpl._reset_characteristics resets card_types to _original_card_types, keywords to _original_keywords.\n   - Converge: real pipeline sets colors_spent as list; FDN converge tests set int (Wardens defaults `self.colors_spent: int = 0`). Handle both: `len(cs) if isinstance(cs, list) else cs`.\n   - Counterspell pattern (fdn_153): can_cast scans `game.stack.objects()` for non-self spell; get_targets returns TargetRequirement(zone=Zone.STACK); `_counter_spell(game, stack_obj)` pops from `game.stack._items`, removes card from controller STACK zone, adds to owner graveyard; `_get_chosen_target` reads chosen_targets[0] else _resolve_target.\n   - Planeswalker loyalty (fdn_44): get_loyalty_abilities returns [LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost, effect, description)]; abilities.py LoyaltyAbilityInstance enforces sorcery-speed + once-per-turn; `target = getattr(pw, '_resolve_target', None)` backdoor; emblem via `type('Emblem',(),{'name':...})()` + register SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger.\n   - ManaAbility (fdn_245): get_mana_abilities returns [ManaAbility(cost=_tap_cost, mana_produced=effect)]; resolves immediately. `_tap_cost(game, source)` checks/sets is_tapped.\n   - Modes (fdn_215): get_modes + `self.chosen_mode`; on_resolve branches on mode.\n   - GameState: advance_phase rotates turns (extra_turns FIFO of seat indices, _normal_next_index), empties mana pools on every transition. No turn-skip support. _TURN_SEQUENCE has main phases as (PRECOMBAT_MAIN, None) and (POSTCOMBAT_MAIN, None).\n   - turn.py run_turn: untap clears summoning_sick + resets land_plays_remaining=1; upkeep fires BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent (no player field → use game.active_player in condition); main phases currently do nothing; priority granted except Untap/Cleanup. game.py draw_card increments `player.cards_drawn_this_turn` (never reset anywhere currently).\n   - Keyword Flag enum: FLYING, FIRST_STRIKE, DOUBLE_STRIKE, DEATHTOUCH, TRAMPLE, LIFELINK, VIGILANCE, REACH, HASTE, FLASH, DEFENDER, HEXPROOF, INDESTRUCTIBLE, MENACE, WARD, PROWESS. NO AFFINITY/CASUALTY/MIRACLE/CONVERGE/PARADIGM/PREPARED/SURVEIL keywords — implement those via hooks, do not add to keywords.\n   - SBA (state_based_actions.py): _sba_creature_zero_toughness checks `hasattr(obj,'toughness') and obj.toughness <= 0` — CRITICAL for Great Hall: must NOT expose toughness when un-animated.\n   - test_utils: create_game(deck1, deck2, *, scripts=(s1,s2)); set_board_state(game, idx, *, battlefield, hand, graveyard, life, mana); cast_spell(game, idx, name, targets) prepends `reversed(targets)` via `player._script.appendleft`, then auto-resolves via _resolve_top_of_stack (pop+on_resolve+SBA until empty); declare_attackers(game, names) prepends attacker list and calls declare_attackers_step; advance_to_phase; declare_blockers. SpellCast/casualty additional choices must be scripted in the base script AFTER the prepended targets.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/AGENTS.md`, `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md`: constraints + layout. FDN cards with tests.py: fdn_13, fdn_142, fdn_205, fdn_215, fdn_244.\n   - `/workspace/engine/casting.py`: (TO EDIT) `get_cost_reduction` (add static_cost_reduction iteration over controller battlefield); `cast_spell` (add `card.mana_spent = total_before - total_after` around `player.mana_pool.pay(effective_cost)`; fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent after `game.stack.push(stack_obj)`; call apply_casualty); `cast_spell_free` (set `card.mana_spent = 0`, fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent); `_resolve_spell` (route instant/sorcery to Zone.EXILE when `getattr(card,'_exile_instead_of_graveyard', False)`). Possibly add optional `alternative_cost` param to cast_spell for miracle.\n   - `/workspace/engine/combat.py`: (TO EDIT) `declare_attackers_step` — fire `AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature=attacker, attacker=attacker)` for declared attackers (after registering them).\n   - `/workspace/engine/events.py`: All event dataclasses (read in full). PLAN: add `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=None)`.\n   - `/workspace/engine/turn.py`: (TO EDIT) fire BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent at PRECOMBAT_MAIN/POSTCOMBAT_MAIN with player=game.active_player; possibly reset cards_drawn_this_turn at untap for miracle.\n   - `/workspace/engine/card.py`, types.py, triggers.py, zones.py, game.py, abilities.py, game_state.py, continuous_effects.py, stack.py, player.py, replacement_effects.py, test_utils.py: all read in full this session (no edits).\n   - PLAN new file `/workspace/engine/casualty.py`: `apply_casualty(game, card, controller, stack_obj)` — finds permanents with `grants_casualty(game, card, controller)` hook returning N; if instant/sorcery and creature(power≥N) exists, choose_yes_no, choose creature, sacrifice, then `copy_spell` + push.\n   - FDN references read this session: fdn_44 KaitoCunningInfiltrator (Planeswalker pattern), fdn_245 RubyDaringTracker (AttacksTriggeredEvent condition `event.creature is source`, ManaAbility, EOT MODIFY_PT buff via `source.modified_power += 2`), fdn_153 EssenceScatter (_get_chosen_target + _counter_spell), fdn_205 WardensOfTheCycle (converge int colors_spent, range loop create_token), fdn_244 Progenitus (ProtectionAbility re-init in _reset_characteristics, MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent condition `event.card is source`, sets event.prevented=True), fdn_95 SowerOfChaos (get_activated_abilities, cost pays mana_pool, effect uses `_current_target`), fdn_13 FleetingFlight (TargetRequirement battlefield, add_counter + sync _base_plus_one_counters, EOT ContinuousEffect Layer.ABILITY granting flying), fdn_215 Bushwhack (get_modes + self.chosen_mode, library basic-land search, fight via deal_damage).\n   - All 10 SOS specs captured: \n     - sos_1 The Dawning Archaic {10} 7/7 Legendary Avatar, Reach; {1} less per instant/sorcery in graveyard; attack→may free-cast target instant/sorcery from graveyard, exile instead.\n     - sos_4 Together as One Sorcery {6} Converge: target player draws X, deal X to any target, gain X life (X=colors spent).\n     - sos_13 \"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\" Creature {1}{W}{W}//{W} 3/3 Cat Cleric; ETB target player makes 1/1 W/B flying Inkling, then if opponent has more creatures becomes \"prepared\"; Prepared keyword.\n     - sos_57 Mana Sculpt Instant {1}{U}{U}: counter target spell; if you control a Wizard, add {C}=mana spent to cast it at beginning of your next main phase.\n     - sos_97 \"Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer\" Planeswalker {1}{B}{B} loyalty 3, Ral; +1 Surveil 2; −1 any number of target players each discard; −2 return target creature card MV≤3 from your graveyard to battlefield; −7 flip 5 coins, target opponent skips X turns (X=heads).\n     - sos_120 Improvisation Capstone Sorcery—Lesson {5}{R}{R}: exile top until total MV≥4, may cast any number free; Paradigm.\n     - sos_201 \"Lorehold, the Historian\" {3}{R}{W} 5/5 Flying Haste Legendary Elder Dragon; instants/sorceries in hand have miracle {2}; each opponent's upkeep may discard to draw.\n     - sos_226 \"Silverquill, the Disputant\" {2}{W}{B} 4/4 Flying Vigilance Legendary Elder Dragon; your instant/sorcery spells have casualty 1.\n     - sos_245 \"Witherbloom, the Balancer\" {6}{B}{G} 5/5 Flying Deathtouch Legendary Elder Dragon; affinity for creatures (self); your instant/sorcery spells have affinity for creatures.\n     - sos_257 \"Great Hall of the Biblioplex\" Land; {T}:Add {C}; {T},Pay 1 life: add any color (instant/sorcery only); {5}: becomes 2/4 Wizard creature \"Whenever you cast an instant/sorcery, this gets +1/+0 EOT\", still a land.\n   - `/workspace/engine_tests/test_cost_reduction.py`: read in full — uses empty-battlefield GameStates and `not game.stack.is_empty()`; confirms my get_cost_reduction iteration is safe.\n   - `/workspace/engine_tests/test_combat.py` (lines 235–355): declare_attackers tests use scripted attacker lists; firing AttacksTriggeredEvent is a no-op (no triggers). `_make_game(p1_script=[[bear]])` exact scripts confirm no extra consumption.\n   - `/workspace/engine_tests/