{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Implement 10 SOS Magic: The Gathering card implementations in `/workspace/cards/sos/`: cards 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257. Each card directory has `card_spec.json` (metadata) and a stub `card_impl.py` (`class X(CardImpl): pass`) to complete. Use completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as examples. Consult `RULEBOOK.txt` via grep (never read whole). The agent is \"expected to make changes to the engine to implement new keywords and mechanics\" and is \"free to make changes that don't break current behavior.\" Write per-card tests at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py`. Run tests from workspace root with `pytest` (interpreter is `python3`, not `python`).\n\n   Hard constraints (MUST be preserved verbatim):\n   - \"Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading. Modifying the workspace tests will not change your score — it will only mislead you about whether your engine changes are correct.\"\n   - Do NOT modify or delete existing FDN reference test files at `cards/fdn/fdn_*/tests.py` (read for examples only).\n   - Engine modifications are ADDITIVE-ONLY: may add new methods/classes/helpers/files in `engine/` and may modify the bodies of existing functions, but MUST NOT rename, move, or delete anything existing in `engine/`.\n   - Each card's implementation class must remain in `cards/sos/{card_id}/card_impl.py`; do not move/rename card directories.\n   - Per-card SOS tests belong at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py`.\n   - pytest.ini sets `python_files = test_*.py tests.py`, 5-minute per-test timeout.\n\n   Final message: produce a TEXT-ONLY summary (no tool calls).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Layered MTG engine: CardImpl/Creature/Instant/Sorcery/Planeswalker/Land/Enchantment hierarchy, GameState, Stack/StackObject, TriggerManager, ReplacementManager, EffectManager, CombatState, ManaPool, DeterministicPlayer.\n   - Card hooks: can_cast, cost_reduction(game), on_cast, on_resolve (reads self.chosen_targets), get_targets (list[TargetRequirement(filter_fn, description, zone)]), register_triggers, register_replacement_effects, get_activated_abilities, get_modes, Planeswalker.get_loyalty_abilities, Land.get_mana_abilities.\n   - NEW hooks (additive, no-op when unused): `static_cost_reduction(game, card, controller)->int` and `grants_casualty(game, card, controller)->int` (both queried over battlefield permanents).\n   - `cast_spell(game, player, card, *, from_zone=Zone.HAND, alternative_cost=None, bypass_timing=False)`: when alternative_cost given, use it & skip cost reduction; when bypass_timing, skip timing check; from_zone determines source container (and rollback). Sets card.mana_spent, card.colors_spent; calls _apply_casualty; fires SpellCastTriggeredEvent.\n   - cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone) — free cast from any zone (from_zone positional); sets mana_spent=0; fires SpellCastTriggeredEvent.\n   - _resolve_spell: permanents→battlefield; elif getattr(card,\"_exile_instead_of_graveyard\",False)→STACK→EXILE; else STACK→GRAVEYARD. Sets card.chosen_targets from stack_obj.targets before on_resolve.\n   - TriggerManager.register(TriggerRegistration(event_type, condition, effect, source, controller)); unregister(source) identity-based; fire_event no-ops when no match; effect becomes pushed StackObject.on_resolve.\n   - move_to_zone: fires ETB event BEFORE registering the entering permanent's own triggers (so self-ETB triggers don't catch their own entry through normal flow); only unregisters triggers/replacements when LEAVING battlefield; consults replacements only when leaving battlefield. Spell resolution (STACK→GRAVEYARD/EXILE) does NOT leave battlefield, so triggers with source=self persist (used for Improvisation Capstone Paradigm + Mana Sculpt delayed mana).\n   - set_board_state bypasses move_to_zone → register_triggers NOT called automatically; tests must call card.register_triggers(game) manually AND fire EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent manually for self-ETB triggers.\n   - Events: DrawsCardTriggeredEvent(player, card); BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent (NO player field — use game.active_player; opponent's upkeep = `game.active_player is not controller`); BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player) (fired in turn.py for both PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN with player=game.active_player; gate to precombat via `game.phase == Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN`); EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent(permanent, controller, ...) — condition `event.permanent is source`; AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature, attacker); SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell, player, card, controller).\n   - draw_card increments player.cards_drawn_this_turn (now reset to 0 for all players at untap step) and fires DrawsCardTriggeredEvent.\n   - ManaCost.cmc property = generic + sum(pips.values()) + len(hybrid) (X treated as 0). ManaCost.parse(str). create_token fires ETB for the token (won't re-trigger a self-ETB condition keyed on a different object).\n   - Planeswalker(starting_loyalty=N, **kwargs); get_loyalty_abilities()->[LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost, effect, description)]. LoyaltyAbilityInstance(source, controller, loyalty_cost, effect, description) activated via activate_ability; sorcery-speed only; once-per-turn tracked via _loyalty_activated_this_turn set keyed (object_id, turn_number); clear_loyalty_tracking() resets; loyalty cost adjusts source.loyalty (raises AbilityError if would go below 0). Targets read via `getattr(pw, \"_resolve_target\", None)` (FDN convention).\n   - extra_turns: list[int] FIFO queue of player seat indices; appending a seat gives that player an extra turn (advance_phase pops them). Turn-SKIPPING mechanism not yet examined.\n   - DeterministicPlayer: choose/choose_target/choose_yes_no/choose_card/assign_damage_order all pop from _script (deque). create_game(scripts=([...],[...])) or set player._script = deque([...]). test_utils.cast_spell prepends reversed(targets), then auto-resolves stack; additional non-target choices go in the base script after prepended targets.\n   - Keyword flags: FLYING, HASTE, VIGILANCE, DEATHTOUCH, REACH, etc. (NO Prepared/Paradigm/Miracle/Surveil keyword in enum — implement via hooks/state, do not add to enum). Supertype.LEGENDARY for legendary.\n   - ZoneContainer: add(obj, position=\"top\") appends (top=last); top(1) returns last element; remove identity-based; get_all() bottom→top; contains identity-based; __len__.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/engine/casting.py` (EDITED):\n     - cast_spell signature now `def cast_spell(game, player, card, *, from_zone: Zone = Zone.HAND, alternative_cost: ManaCost | None = None, bypass_timing: bool = False) -> None:`.\n     - Timing: `if (not bypass_timing and not can_cast_at_instant_speed(card) and not is_sorcery_speed(game, player)): raise CastingError(...)`.\n     - Source zone: `hand = player.zones[from_zone]; if not hand.contains(card): raise CastingError(f\"Cannot cast {card.name!r} — card not in {from_zone.name.lower()}\")` (lower() keeps \"card not in hand\" for engine test).\n     - Cost: `if alternative_cost is not None: effective_cost = alternative_cost; else: reduction = get_cost_reduction(...); effective_cost = _apply_cost_reduction(...) if reduction>0 else card.mana_cost`.\n     - get_cost_reduction adds permanents' static_cost_reduction; _apply_casualty + SpellCastTriggeredEvent fired after push; cast_spell_free sets mana_spent=0; _resolve_spell handles _exile_instead_of_graveyard.\n   - `/workspace/engine/turn.py` (EDITED): _do_untap_step now adds after `active.land_plays_remaining = 1`: `for player in game.players: player.cards_drawn_this_turn = 0`. run_turn fires BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=game.active_player) at both main phases; fires BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent() at upkeep.\n   - `/workspace/engine/events.py`: contains DrawsCardTriggeredEvent, BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent (no player), BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player), EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent(permanent, controller, card, creature), etc.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py` (WRITTEN, 6 tests pass): LoreholdTheHistorian(Creature) {3}{R}{W} 5/5 FLYING|HASTE LEGENDARY {\"Elder\",\"Dragon\"}. register_triggers registers (a) DrawsCardTriggeredEvent miracle trigger using `_make_miracle_condition(source)` factory (condition: event.player is controller, drawn card is instant/sorcery, controller.cards_drawn_this_turn==1, card still in hand; stashes `source._pending_miracle_card`), effect `_miracle_effect` → `_cast_for_miracle` (choose_yes_no, can_pay({2}) check, `cast_spell(game, controller, card, alternative_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{2}\"), bypass_timing=True)` in try/except CastingError); (b) BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent loot trigger (condition: `g.active_player is not controller`; effect: choose_yes_no → choose_card → discard → draw_card). Module helper `_is_instant_or_sorcery(card)`.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py` (WRITTEN, 6 pass): tests basic chars, miracle cast for {2}, miracle declined, miracle only for first card (cards_drawn_this_turn=1 pre-set→becomes 2), loot on opponent upkeep (active_player_index=1; drawn card made a Creature so loot draw can't re-trigger miracle), no loot on own upkeep. Uses `_put_on_library_top`, `_resolve_all`, _Bolt(Instant {3}{R}).\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py` (WRITTEN, 5 tests pass):\n     - `SwordsToPlowshares(Instant)` {W}: get_targets→creature; on_resolve exiles target via `from engine.game import exile`, target_controller.life += target.power. Sets self.colors={\"W\"}.\n     - `_make_inkling_token()`: Creature(name=\"Inkling\", subtypes={\"Inkling