{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01C2dJxvKWGe2CBk4WM6yyP8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All changes are confined to the 10 SOS card implementations, their new test files, additive engine modifications, and `run_manifest.json` — no `engine_tests/` or `cards/fdn/` files were touched.\n\n## Summary\n\nAll 10 SOS cards (1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257) are implemented with passing tests. **Full suite: 1238 passed, 0 regressions.**\n\nThis session completed the final two cards:\n\n**SOS #97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer** (`cards/sos/sos_97/card_impl.py`): a Legendary Planeswalker with four loyalty abilities — +1 Surveil 2, −1 target players discard, −2 reanimate a creature with MV ≤ 3, and −7 flip five coins to make a target opponent skip that many turns. Required three additive engine helpers:\n- `engine/game.py`: `surveil(game, player, n)` and `flip_coins(game, player, n)`.\n- `engine/game_state.py`: a `skip_turns` counter consulted during normal turn rotation in `advance_phase` (no-op when empty, so existing behavior is unchanged).\n\n**SOS #257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex** (`cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py`): a `Land` with two mana abilities ({T}: {C}; {T}+1 life: any color) and a {5} animate ability turning it into a 2/4 Wizard that gets +1/+0 per instant/sorcery cast until end of turn. The key correctness detail: while un-animated it does **not** expose `power`/`toughness` (the properties raise `AttributeError`), so the zero-toughness state-based action skips it — verified by a dedicated test. Animation persists through `apply_all` via an overridden `_reset_characteristics`, which also clears the end-of-turn pump.\n\nBoth cards reuse the previously added `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`. All engine changes remain additive (no renames/removals)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":148261,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"735f529e-7bc8-4328-a211-d2f095818fd0","uuid":"c943c0f8-2d35-44cf-bf5f-ba67acab03fe","request_id":"req_011Cbi5YaZ5ssgaHiN9Atnr9"}
